  We first give some technical lemmas in Section~\ref{subsec:combnoose} to bound the number of ways a separator of the sphere-cut decomposition can be routed through a plane pattern. We describe and analyze  embedded dynamic programming in Section~\ref{subsec:embdp} followed by subsuming the entire algorithm for {\sc Plane Subgraph Isomorphism} in Section~\ref{subsec:alg}.
  In Section~\ref{sec:planesubiso} we bound the number of drawings of the pattern  and show how to solve {\sc Planar Subgraph Isomorphism}.
