 the  faces intersected by a noose $N$. % by $F(N) = N \cap F(G)$. 
 The \emph{length}  of $N$ is  the number $|V(N)|$ of vertices in $V(N)$. The clockwise order in which $N$ meets the vertices of $V(N)$ is a cyclic permutation $\pi$ on the set $V(N)$.
