 Before proving this lemma,  % we are able to prove Lemma~\ref{lem:numradwalks}, 
 we  show that  every combinatorial noose of a plane graph on $k$ vertices corresponds to a cycle in some other plane graph on  at most $O(k)$ vertices. 
