+The pattern graph H is the cycle C_{n}: its vertices are 0,1,...,{n - 1},
+and its edges are {{i,(i+1) mod {n}}} for every i.  The host graph G is a
+simple undirected planar graph on the same vertex set 0,1,...,{n - 1}.
