%in several fundamental enumerative combinatorics results, which 
To obtain a good bound on the parameter function, we apply several fundamental enumerative combinatorics results in the technical sections of this work. Next to the number of cycles and face-vertex sequences in embedded graphs, 
%so-called plane walks in the pattern,
 these counting results give upper bounds on the number of planar triangulations %of a graph
  and planar embeddings of the  pattern.
