Rejected after full-paper and construction-aware audit.

The planted family passes generation and exact verification, but fails Track A hardness: an exact-2-in-4 neighbourhood attack recovered a verified Hamiltonian cycle on 7/8 seeds at both \(n=120\) and \(n=148\). Track B also fails because the post-insight route is the same search—median 13,973 nodes, exceeding the 300-operation limit.

