- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0909.4692/REJECTED.md:1) — theorem basis, measurements, and Track B comparison
- [rejected_gen_0909_4692.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0909.4692/rejected_gen_0909_4692.py:423) — retained generator with the breaking attack
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0909.4692/selftest_report.json) — records G5/G6 and no-tool failures
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/0909.4692/README.md:3) — updated status and historical results

No further paid hardening calls were run because the local adversary panel had already invalidated the family.
